      "description": "The Strategic Communications Specialist is a member of the strategic communications team who supports reputation management, crisis response and mitigation, and media relations strategies for colleges and schools. The specialist also contributes to executive communications for the Office of the President. The specialist will help conduct research and seek opportunities to promote DePaul’s reputation to a wide range of internal and external audiences. The specialist will leverage social listening tools to track digital reputation and risks. This position requires a strategic thinker with outstanding editorial and writing skills. ",
      "department": null
