      "title": "PT Digital Minister for Vincentian Formation",
      "description": "The Part-Time Digital Minister for Vincentian Formation develops, curates, and shares digital resources that support Vincentian formation for students, faculty, staff, and administrators. Working under the guidance of the Associate Director for Vincentian Formation and in collaboration with DMM staff, student employees, and campus partners, this position identifies formation needs and in response creates engaging resources in a variety of formats, including written content, videos, podcasts, websites, and social media. The position also coaches student employees and partners involved in digital resource development. Through this work, the Digital Minister serves the institutional need and strategic goal to showcase the relevance of DePaul's Catholic and Vincentian mission.",
